Needs:

Revenue

Occupancy

Payments

Reports

Business overview

---

## Property Manager

Manages daily operations.

Needs:

Tenant management

Room management

Maintenance

Billing

Tasks

---

## Technician

Receives maintenance tickets.

Updates work progress.

Uploads photos.

Completes jobs.

Uses mobile devices most of the time.

---

## Housekeeper

Receives cleaning tasks.

Marks rooms completed.

Uploads room photos.

Uses mobile devices.

---

## Tenant

Mainly interacts through LINE OA.

Can

Report issues

View invoices

Receive announcements

Pay bills

